    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly bring to the market 9 Hillcrest Avenue, Lucan. A well-presented, extended, 3 bedroom property with the additional benefit of an attic conversion. Situated in the highly sought after and mature development of Hillcrest, Lucan, this location is hard to beat as within a stone's throw you will find a variety of local amenities including schools, shops, local sport facilities and not to mention great access points to the N4/M50 road networks. Bright, airy and extended living accommodation of c. 118 can be found here and in brief this property consists of entrance hall, wc, lounge and open plan kitchen/family/diner to the ground floor. on the first floor you will find three bedrooms, the family bathroom and stair case access to the converted attic. Externally you will find a fully enclosed rear garden with patio area and a brick built storage unit whilst the front offer a gated driveway for off road parking. No. 9 comes to the market in good condition throughout and further benefits here include gas fired central heating, double glazed windows and is offered to the market with no onward chain. Based on recent success in this development we know this will be extremely popular so please call Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest.\n\n\nBER D2\nc. 118 Sqm\n3 Bedrooms\n2 Bath\nExtended to the rear\nConverted attic\nNo onward chain\nMature and highly desirable location\nFantastic opportunity\nWest facing garden\nMature development\nGas central heating\nClose to amenities\nDouble glazed windows\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nFrom the N4, take the Lucan exit. At the lights, turn right onto Hillcrest Road and continue to roundabout. When you reach the roundabout take the 2nd exit onto Hillcrest Drive and follow the road round, Hillcrest Avenue will be your 2nd left turn."
      },
